Begin3
Title:          UNARJ -- extract, test and view RAR archives
Version:        2.63a
Entered-date:   11MAR2002
Description:    The UNARJ utility is a freeware program distributed with
                source code and developed for extracting, testing and viewing
                the contents of archives created with the ARJ archiver.
                This is a modified version. The directory creation patch was
		applied.
Keywords:       archiver, uncompress, unpack, data compression, arj
Author:         Robert K. Joung robjung@world.std.com
Original-site:  ftp://ftp.std.com/pub/arj/
                97799 unarj263.exe
Primary-site:   ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/utils/compress/
                28kB unarj-2.63a.tar.gz
Platforms:      UNARJ is known to run on the following platforms:
                DOS, OS/2, Win32, Unix
Copying-policy: Copyrighted but freely distributable.
End
